# Help Desk spreadsheet hookup
# 1. Finish the checklist at the top of scripts/helpdesk-sheets-apps-script.gs
# 2. Paste the Web app URL below (no quotes)
# 3. Save this file as .env (same folder as package.json)
# 4. Restart: npm run dev
#
# GitHub Pages: also add the same value as a repo secret named
# VITE_HELPDESK_SHEETS_URL (Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions),
# then re-run the Deploy workflow so production builds include it.

VITE_HELPDESK_SHEETS_URL=

# Optional
# VITE_ADMIN_PASSWORD=organics-admin
